    "headline": "Yape enhances CX with Zendesk Copilot for faster and more efficient resolutions",
    "deck": "Yape, one of the leading superapps in Peru, elevated its customer support experience by integrating Zendesk AI agents and Copilot. With intelligent real-time assistance, agents now work faster, more consistently, and with greater confidence—boosting both user satisfaction and team efficiency. During a pilot, Yape achieved a 15 percent increase in agent productivity, a ~10 percent reduction in handling time, and a double-digit improvement in internal NPS.",
